\section{Detection}{

\code{\link[=nowcast]{nowcast()}} attaches a revision process when the \code{tbl_now} carries
\code{revision_date} / \code{revision_type} (see
\code{tbl.now::add_revision_date()}).

Count-cumulative data instead use \code{\link[=cumulative_process]{cumulative_process()}}, whose primitive
retraction object is the finite-age kernel \code{h_R}; it does not estimate \code{p}.
